{"segment_id": "segment_00006", "start": 180.0, "end": 210.0, "speech": "when 对整句话，why 对整句话，OK。第五个，He wondered why he was wanted by the police。这地方注意一个小点，wondered 和 was 貌似都能变一般疑问句，我们要用主句的，不要用宾语从句的，所以应该是 did 提前，对吧？那 what 就是直接对 why he was wanted by the police 提问，所以答案叫 what did he wonder？啊，他好奇，他感觉到什么？感觉到很奇怪", "frames": [{"path": "frames/frame_000016.webp", "time": 183.0, "ocr": {"texts": ["Asking questions"], "scores": [0.99718], "boxes": [[[90.0, 132.0], [496.0, 138.0], [495.0, 206.0], [89.0, 199.0]]]}}], "review_flags": [], "asr_model": "Qwen/Qwen3-ASR-1.7B"}
